OL,3,AProtests as controversial Drumcree
OL,4,AOrange Order march due to go ahead for
OL,5,Afirst time since 1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order is due
OL,9,Fto go down the mainly nationalist
OL,10,FGarvaghy Road later this morning for
OL,11,Fthe first time in almost 30 years
OL,13,FHowever hundreds of protesters,
OL,14,Fincluding Northern Ireland First
OL,15,FMinister Michelle O'Neill and other
OL,16,Fnationalist politicians, have blocked
OL,17,Fthe road
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
