OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AProtests as controversial Drumcree
OL,4,AOrange Order march due to go ahead for
OL,5,Afirst time since 1997
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe parade was due to begin at 08:00
OL,8,FBST but Orangemen, who have gathered at
OL,9,FDrumcree Church to begin their march,
OL,10,Fsay they will wait until the road is
OL,11,Fclear
OL,13,FThe Orange Order, the most prominent of
OL,14,Fthe loyal orders associated with
OL,15,FProtestants, say the Garvaghy Road is
OL,16,Fpart of its traditional marching route
OL,17,Fbut the event is opposed by many
OL,18,FCatholic residents who live there
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
